Negative control for domain-template.test.ts.

Declares the pick with the drawer template, which its record does not carry, as
its fallback, so a brand with no template, an empty one, or a name the page
does not lay out gets no layout instead of the full one. The full template
still draws its own layout.

Intended RED (domain-template.test.ts, "domainTemplate"):
  draws the full layout for no template
  draws the full layout for an empty template
  draws the full layout for the drawer template the organism draws itself
  draws the full layout for the widget template the organism draws itself
  draws the full layout for a template only other pages carry
  draws the full layout for a name no layout carries
  draws the full layout for a name every object inherits
Intended GREEN:
  draws the layout the <each> template carries

